        "node_id": "n_1_eaf9b4",
        "thought_text": "Calculate the remainder when $a$ is divided by $b$. If the remainder is 0, then no moves are needed. Otherwise, the number of moves required is $b - \\text{remainder}$.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1791451886.2728572
      },
      "rev_n_2_b94e8b_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_b94e8b_0",
        "node_id": "n_2_b94e8b",
        "thought_text": "Use the modulo operation to find the smallest non-negative integer $k$ such that $(a + k) \\mod b = 0$. This can be efficiently computed as $k = (b - (a \\mod b)) \\mod b$.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1791451886.2728682
